              "text": "perficiō, perficere — \"to complete, to carry out\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mūrum novum tandem perfēcērunt. At last they completed the new wall."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "perficiō, perficere, perfēcī, perfectum: per 'through' + faciō. English perfect."
            }
          ]
        },
